mmidoc brings up complete documentation on the Micro Magic Tools.

For mmidoc to work, you need to have the MMI tools properly installed
(see ../README).  

Since the MMI release does not currently include an html browser, you
will also need an installed web browser at your site, before you can
use this program.  If your web browser is not netscape, make sure the
BROWSER or MMI_BROWSER environment variable is set to its name.

